OL,3,GNEWSAManx passport applications move
OL,4,Aonline
OL,5,
OL,6,FManx residents can now apply to get a
OL,7,Fpassport online as the Isle of Man
OL,8,FGovernment said it was "modernising
OL,9,Fpublic services."
OL,11,FOnline applications become the primary
OL,12,Fway to apply for the document however
OL,13,Fthe paper form will remain available
OL,14,Ffor those unable to use the online
OL,15,Fservice.
OL,17,FTreasury Minister, Michael Crowe MHK,
OL,18,Fdescribed the move, which is intended
OL,19,Fto quicken the process and provide a
OL,20,Fcheaper option, as "a positive step".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
